@*
    Electronic Delivery Disclosure for Form 1095-C.
    PLACEHOLDER WORDING — to be reviewed/approved by the client's legal/compliance team.
    Covers the 7 IRS-required disclosure elements for electronic furnishing.
*@
<div class="disclosure-content text-dark">

    <p class="mb-4 text-dark">
        Please review the terms below before consenting to receive your ACA tax forms (Form 1095-B/Form 1095-C) electronically.
    </p>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">1</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Right to a paper copy</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">If you do not consent to electronic delivery, you will receive your Form 1095-B/Form 1095-C on paper by mail at no cost.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">2</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Scope and duration of consent</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">Your consent applies to your Form 1095-B/Form 1095-C and remains in effect for the current and future tax years until you withdraw it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">3</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Requesting a paper copy later</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">You may request a paper copy at any time by contacting your employer's HR department. A paper request does not, by itself, withdraw your consent for future years unless you choose to withdraw it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">4</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Withdrawing consent</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">You may withdraw consent at any time — electronically through this portal ("Withdraw Electronic Consent") or on paper by contacting HR. A withdrawal takes effect for forms not yet furnished when it is processed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">5</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">When electronic delivery ends</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">Electronic delivery may cease if your employment ends, if you withdraw consent, or if your employer stops furnishing forms electronically.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">6</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Updating your contact information</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">Keep your notification email current in this portal so you receive notices when a form is available. You can update it on the delivery preference form.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex mb-4">
        <span class="avatar avatar-sm flex-shrink-0 me-3"><span class="avatar-initial rounded-circle bg-primary text-white">7</span></span>
        <div>
            <h6 class="mb-1 text-dark fw-semibold">Hardware and software required</h6>
            <p class="small text-dark mb-0">To access, print, and retain your Form 1095-B/Form 1095-C you need internet access, a current web browser, and a PDF reader. The form remains available in your account through October 15 of the year after the tax year, and may need to be printed to file a paper tax return.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border rounded p-2 small text-dark">
        <i class="bx bx-check-shield me-1"></i> By consenting, you confirm you can access this disclosure and your Form 1095-B/Form 1095-C in electronic format.
    </div>
</div>
